# ScamHunt runs fully offline using a local heuristic analysis engine
# (see engine.py) — no API key is required for any core feature.
#
# The variables below are OPTIONAL hooks for future integration with an
# external AI/LLM provider (e.g. to generate richer natural-language
# explanations on top of the local engine's score/category/indicators).
# The app does not currently call any external AI API, and must not
# silently fabricate results if these are unset — it will simply keep
# using the local deterministic engine.

# Example (unused unless you wire up ai_client.py yourself):
# AI_API_PROVIDER=anthropic
# AI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# AI_API_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# Optional: override where uploaded evidence / exports are stored
# SCAMHUNT_DATA_DIR=./data
